OL,3,GNEWSAInside the shop that inspired the
OL,4,Asecond-hand fashion boom
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe is worried society's approach to
OL,7,Fclothing has become "wasteful" and says
OL,8,Fshe has noticed a deterioration in the
OL,9,Fquality of the new clothing on offer.
